     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>First step: You can use the base 6 multiplication table.</p>\n<p>In base 6:</p>\n<p>4 times 3 is 20.</p>\n<p>2 times 3 is 10.</p>\n<p>4 times 5 is 32.</p>\n<p>2 times 5 is 14.</p>\n<p>Remember to pad the entries by the appropriate number of zeros.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>×</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: In the rightmost column:</p>\n<p>base 10: 0 + 0 + 0 + 0 = 0</p>\n<p>base 6: 0</p>\n<p>Write 0 in the rightmost column.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>×</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: In the next column over:</p>\n<p>In base 10: 2 + 0 + 2 + 0 = 4</p>\n<p>In base 6: 4</p>\n<p>In this column, write 4.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>×</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: In the next column over:</p>\n<p>In base 10: 1 + 3 + 4 = 8 = 6 + 2</p>\n<p>In base 6: 12</p>\n<p>In this column, write 2.</p>\n<p>Carry: 1</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>×</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td> 2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: In the rightmost column:</p>\n<p>base 10: 1 + 1 = 2</p>\n<p>base 6: 2</p>\n<p>In the rightmost column, write 2.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>×</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carry:</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product:</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td> 2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{2240_6}\"></span></p>"
